  "title": "TileOrientation",
  "description": "How cells are laid out. - `orthogonal`: rectangles in rows and columns. - `isometric`: diamonds along two diagonal axes. - `staggered`: diamonds in rows and columns, every other row (or column) shifted by half a cell. - `hexagonal`: hexagons laid out like `staggered`, with straight sides of TileProjectionOptions.hexSideLength along the stagger axis.",
